  "title": "Milk Chocolate Pecan Pie",
  "description": "A sweet, butter and egg mixture is combined with lots of pecans and milk chocolate pieces, spooned into a prepared pie crust and baked. The chocolate melts, the pecans get gooey, and the crust turns golden brown.",
  "authors": [
    "CORWYNN DARKHOLME"
